A('1964-1230-train', '1964-12-30', VH, 'Long Khánh. The province\'s local troops overturn a Saigon train, Dec. 30 or 31.', 'III, 387', to='1964-12-31', place='long-khanh', also=OP, check='the day; the history gives "Dec. 30 and 31" for this act and the Đồng Sổ ambush together.')
A('1964-12-tamky', '1964-12', VH, 'Quảng Nam. In December, at the time of the An Lão fight, the province\'s armed forces raid the Saigon side in Tam Kỳ town, and the people of the area rise and break the strategic hamlets, widening the area they hold to the edge of the town.', 'III, 392', when='Dec.', place='tam-ky', also=OP, check='the day.')
A('1964-12-cayxanh', '1964-12', VH, 'Quảng Nam. In December, at the time of the An Lão fight, the province\'s armed forces shell the Cây Xanh strongpoint, near Tam Kỳ.', 'III, 392', when='Dec.', place='quang-nam', also=OP, check='the day; the place of Cây Xanh not given beyond the province.')
