A('1964-12-phutho', '1964-12', VH, 'Khánh Hòa. In December the province\'s armed force destroys the Phú Thọ post and breaks the hold on Ninh Phú, Ninh Đa and Vạn Hưng communes; the people rise and free 11 communes of Diên Khánh and Ninh Hòa.', 'III, 393', when='Dec.', place='khanh-hoa', also=OP, check='the day.')
